                "statements": [
                  {
                    "statement-id": "SR-03.13.01.a",
                    "uuid": "c7a69088-d37a-4603-b735-afc47d150db4",
                    "description": "Control: the API Gateway HTTP API (POST /intake) is the only external ingress, and the Lambda's outbound traffic is limited by the security group and gateway endpoint policies. Monitoring: CloudTrail (aws_cloudtrail.mgmt) records management-plane activity. VPC Flow Logs and API Gateway access logs (GAP-08) are not enabled, so data-plane monitoring at these interfaces is not yet implemented."
                  },
                  {
                    "statement-id": "SR-03.13.01.b",
                    "uuid": "84b51b8b-3a3a-482a-9e8b-1d5f9e60f6c5",
                    "description": "The public subnets (aws_subnet.public, routed to the internet gateway) hold no workload components. The Lambda runs only in aws_subnet.private, which aws_route_table.private keeps logically separate, with no internet route."
                  },
